# Godot generated/editor files
.godot/
# Temporary and exported build output
.tmp/
export/
build/
*.log
# NightBorne is approved for game use, but its raw artwork cannot be redistributed.
Sprites/nightborne/*
!Sprites/nightborne/LICENSE.md
# Cainos permits game use but not standalone redistribution of source textures.
Sprites/cainos/*
!Sprites/cainos/LICENSE.md
# User-supplied archer artwork stays local until its distribution terms are known.
Sprites/arcane_archer/*
!Sprites/arcane_archer/SOURCE.md
